{"level":"info","message":"<h3><b>Achievements and Work as a Team</b></h3>\n\nThis week, the team made progress on several key initiatives.  <b>Manas Dadheech</b> worked on DCPEXP-107946, focusing on Prod Amp updates and Streaming UI improvements.  <br>\n<b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> prepared desk check screenshots for a pricing update and also worked on accessibility testing for the membership update flow using a screen reader. <br>\n<b>Tandrima Bhattacharjee</b> resolved tabbing and styling issues related to DCPEXP-108292, prepared for desk checks, and participated in daily standups.  She also submitted a pull request (https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887) and collaborated with <b>Shiv</b> and <b>Narayan</b> on AMP URL modifications and free trial update changes. <br>\n<b>Shivanand Yadav</b> discussed string changes on AMP with <b>Nitish Jain</b> and worked on DCPEXP-106306, focusing on updates to the free trial to paid conversion logic. <br>\n\n\n<h3><b>Leave and Holiday Information</b></h3>\n\nSeveral team members took leave this week.  <b>Diya Khandelwal</b> was on casual leave for three days (March 3rd, 4th and 5th) due to travel to her hometown. <br>\n<b>Manas Dadheech</b> took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd due to illness and travel complications. <br>\n<b>Narayan Shettigar</b> also took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd. <br>\n<b>Shivanand Yadav</b> took a full day of casual leave on March 4th and 5th to attend a family function. <br>\n\n\n<h3><b>Backlogs and Issues</b></h3>\n\nThere were no major backlogs or issues reported this week.  However, ongoing tasks include finalizing the pricing update and completing accessibility testing for the membership update flow. <br>\n\n","service":"summary-service"}
