{"level":"info","message":"<h3>Achievements and Work as a Team</h3>\n\nThis week, the team made progress on several key initiatives.  <b>Manas Dadheech</b> worked on DCPEXP-107946, focusing on Prod Amp updates and Streaming UI improvements.  <br>\n<b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> prepared desk check screenshots for a pricing update and also worked on accessibility testing for the membership update flow. <br>\n<b>Tandrima Bhattacharjee</b> fixed tabbing and styling issues related to DCPEXP-108292, prepared for desk checks, and participated in daily stand-ups.  She also raised a PR at https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887 and assisted <b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> with AMP URL modifications.  <br>\n<b>Shivanand Yadav</b> discussed string changes on AMP with <b>Nitish Jain</b> and worked on DCPEXP-106306, focusing on free trial to paid logic updates.<br>\n\n\n<h3>Leave and Holiday Information</h3>\n\nSeveral team members took leave this week. <b>Diya Khandelwal</b> was on leave for three full days (March 3rd, 4th, and 5th) due to travel. <b>Manas Dadheech</b> took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd. <b>Narayan Shettigar</b> also took a full day of sick leave on March 3rd due to illness. <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> took a full day of casual leave on March 5th and again on March 6th, to attend family functions. <br>\n\n\n<h3>Backlogs and Issues</h3>\n\nNo significant backlogs or issues were reported this week. The team proactively addressed tasks and communicated any challenges encountered. <br>\n\n","service":"summary-service"}
