{"level":"info","message":"<h3><b>Achievements and Work as a Team</b></h3>\n\nThis week, the team made progress on several key initiatives.  <b>Manas Dadheech</b> worked on DCPEXP-107946, focusing on Prod Amp updates and Streaming UI improvements.  <br>\n<b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> prepared deskcheck screenshots for a pricing update and continued working on accessibility testing for the membership update flow using a screen reader. <br>\n<b>Tandrima Bhattacharjee</b> fixed tabbing and styling issues related to DCPEXP-108292, prepared for its desk check, and conducted daily standups.  She also raised a PR at https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887 and assisted <b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> with AMP URL modifications.  <br>\n<b>Shivanand Yadav</b> discussed string changes on AMP with <b>Nitish Jain</b> and worked on DCPEXP-106306, focusing on updates to the free trial to paid logic.  <br>\n\n\n<h3><b>Leave and Holiday Information</b></h3>\n\nSeveral team members took leave this week. <b>Diya Khandelwal</b> was on leave for three full days (March 3rd, 4th, and 5th) due to travel.  <b>Manas Dadheech</b> took one full day of sick leave on March 3rd due to illness and travel complications.  <b>Narayan Shettigar</b> also took one full day of sick leave on March 3rd due to illness.  <b>Shivanand Yadav</b> took a full day of casual leave on March 5th and another full day of casual leave on March 6th for family functions. <br>\n\n\n<h3><b>Backlogs and Issues</b></h3>\n\nNo significant backlogs or issues were reported this week.  However, continued focus on accessibility testing and the completion of DCPEXP-106306 and DCPEXP-107946 remain priorities. <br>\n\n","service":"summary-service"}
