{"level":"info","message":"<h3><b>Achievements and Work as a Team</b></h3>\n\n<b>Manas Dadheech</b> contributed to DCPEXP-107946, focusing on Prod Amp updates and Streaming UI updates.  He also participated in daily stand-ups.\n\n<br>\n\n<b>Shiv Shankar Mistry</b> prepared deskcheck screenshots for a pricing update, continued working on accessibility testing for the membership update flow using a screen reader, and joined team meetings.\n\n<br>\n\n<b>Tandrima Bhattacharjee</b> resolved tabbing and styling issues related to DCPEXP-108292, prepared for desk checks, and participated in daily stand-ups.  She also raised a pull request (https://github.com/krogertechnology/esperanto/pull/29887), assisted Shiv with AMP URL modifications, and collaborated with Narayan on free trial update changes.  Further, she tested voiceover price readouts across various pages.\n\n<br>\n\n<b>Shivanand Yadav</b> engaged in discussions with Nitish about string changes on AMP and worked on DCPEXP-106306, addressing free trial to paid logic updates.\n\n\n<h3><b>Leave and Holiday Information</b></h3>\n\n<b>Shivanand</b> was on leave for a full day on 06-Mar-2025.\n\n\n<h3><b>Backlogs and Issues</b></h3>\n\nNo specific backlogs or issues were explicitly mentioned in the provided updates.  Further investigation may be needed to identify potential roadblocks.\n","service":"summary-service"}
